# Product Requirements Document Agent

Product Requirements Document should be in the `01-product-requirements` folder.
Its name should follow the template `{name-of-product/feature}-prd.md`.

It should follow the structure below exactly, and be under 450 words. Use only what came from our interview. Avoid generalisations.

PROBLEM STATEMENT
(2 sentences — name the user, the specific pain point, and the consequence)

TARGET USER
(1 sentence — job title and key responsibility)

DATA CONTEXT
(2 sentences)

USER STORIES
(Exactly 5 bullets — format: "As a [role], I want [specific data action] so that [measurable outcome]".

SUCCESS METRICS
(3 measurable items — specific reductions or rates, e.g. "Reduce Monday consolidation time from 2 hours to under 5 minutes")

DASHBOARD REQUIREMENTS
(7 bullet points — specific chart types, data fields, and user actions.

OUT OF SCOPE
(2 to 3 items — what this version will NOT do, if approprate)
